{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34353","headline":"早春雪中作吴体寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"早春雪中作吴体寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎春避腊不肯下，欺花冻草还飘然。\n光填马窟盖塞外，势压鹤巢偏殿巅。\n山炉瘿节万状火，墨突乾衰孤穗烟。\n君披鹤氅独自立，何人解道真神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}